# P1 (spread) at 0, 128 and 255 on the 909 clap, the crowd and the 909 rim (flam and drag at 255).
tempo 100
steps 36
tail 1.5
track perc
param p1 0 0
note 0 53 1 120
note 4 58 1 120
note 8 61 1 120
param p1 128 12
note 12 53 1 120
note 16 58 1 120
note 20 61 1 120
param p1 255 24
note 24 53 1 120
note 28 58 1 120
note 32 61 1 120
expect sound 0 36
expect idle 60
expect peak_below -6
